'''Palmer''' (Japanese: '''クロツグ''' ''Kurotsugu'') is the leader of the {{si|Battle Tower}} in [[Pokémon Diamond and Pearl Versions|Pokémon Diamond, Pearl]], [[Pokémon Brilliant Diamond and Shining Pearl|Brilliant Diamond and Shining Pearl]], and the [[Frontier Brain]] of the same facility in {{game|Platinum}}, {{2v2|HeartGold|SoulSilver}}, acting under the title of '''{{tc|Tower Tycoon}}''' (Japanese: '''{{j|タワータイクーン}}''' ''Tower Tycoon'').

In the Japanese version, he shares his {{DL|Pokémon Trainer|Trainer class}} with [[Anabel]], but in the English version, Anabel uses the title of "Salon Maiden" instead.

==In the core series games==
Palmer is {{ga|Barry}}'s father and very similar to his son in look and character, as he is always in a rush. In the [[Sinnoh]] games, he's first encountered when the {{player}} first arrives at the [[Fight Area]]. He's a childhood friend of the Sinnoh player character's father, with whom he experienced a similar start to his {{pkmn|Trainer}} career as the player character does in {{game|Diamond and Pearl|s}}.

In {{g|Brilliant Diamond and Shining Pearl}} only, Palmer can team up with Barry at the {{si|Battle Tower}}, revealing that his son has succeeded in defeating him.

